#: email.cpp:85
msgid "KDE Email Control Module"
msgstr "Kde E-pos Kontrole Module"

#: email.cpp:86
msgid "Configure your identity, email addresses, mail servers, etc."
msgstr "Konfigureer u identiteit, e-pos adresse, pos bedieners, etc."

#: email.cpp:88
msgid "Current maintainer"
msgstr "Huidige onderhouer"

#: email.cpp:191
msgid "New Email Profile"
msgstr "Nuwe E-pos Profiel"

#: email.cpp:198
msgid "Name:"
msgstr "Naam:"

#: email.cpp:219
msgid "Please enter a name for the profile."
msgstr "Voer asseblief die naam van die profiel in."

#: email.cpp:221
msgid "This email profile already exists, and cannot be created again."
msgstr "Hierdie e-pos profiel bestaan alreeds, en kan nie weer geskep word nie"

#: email.cpp:295
msgid ""
"<h1>Email</h1> This module allows you to enter basic email information for the "
"current user. The information here is used, among other things, for sending bug "
"reports to the KDE developers when you use the bug report dialog."
"<p> Note that email programs like KMail offer many more features, but they "
"provide their own configuration facilities."
msgstr ""
"<h1>E-pos</h1>Hierdie module laat u toe om basiese E-pos informasie vir die "
"huidige gebruiker,in te voer. Die informasie wat hier gebruik word, met ander "
"dinge, word gebruikvir die stuur van fout raporte na die Kde ontwikkelaars "
"wanneer u dit gebruik in die fout raporteer dialoog."
"<p> Noteer dat E-pos programme soos Kpos veel meer funksies bied, maar hulle "
"verskaf hulle eie opstelling fasiliteite."

#: email.cpp:314
msgid "Do you wish to discard changes to the current profile?"
msgstr "Wens u veranderinge weg te gooi na die huidige profiel?"

#: email.cpp:315
msgid "Do you wish to save changes to the current profile?"
msgstr "Wens u veranderings te stoor na die huidige profiel?"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-pos"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "User Information"
msgstr "Gebruiker Informasie"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"You can set a reply address if you want replies to your email messages to go to "
"a different address than the email address above. Most likely, you should leave "
"the reply address blank, so replies go to the email address you entered above."
"<p><em> Please note:</em> "
"<ul>"
"<li>You do not need to enter the same email address as above.</li>"
"<li>You should not use a reply address if you frequently use discussion mailing "
"lists.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"U kan 'n antwoord adres instel as u wil hê dat antwoorde na u e-pos boodskappe "
"na 'n anderadres gaan, as die e-pos adres hierbo. Mees waarskynlik, moet u die "
"antwoord adres ooplos,sodat antwoorde kan gaan na die e-pos adres wat u hierbo "
"ingevoer het."
"<p><em> Neem kennis asseblief:</em> "
"<ul>"
"<li>U benodig nie dieselfde e-pos adres as hierbo, in te voer nie.</li>"
"<li>U moet nie 'n antwoord adres gebruik nie, indien u dikwels gesprek poslyste "
"gebruik.</li></ul>"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"Enter your email address here, e.g. \"john@doe.com\" (without the quotation "
"marks). This information is mandatory if you want to use email."
"<p>\n"
"Do <em>not</em> enter something like John Doe &lt;john@doe.com&gt;\", just a "
"plain email address. Your email address must not contain any blank spaces."
msgstr ""
"Voer u e-pos adres hier in, byvoorbeeld \"john@doe.com\" (sonder die aanhaling "
"merk). Hierdie informasie is verpligtend as ue-pos wil gebruik."
"<p>\n"
"Moet <em>nie</em>invoer iets soos john doe &lt;john@doe.com&gt;\", net 'n "
"eenvoudig e-pos adres. U e-pos adres moet nie enige leë spasies bevat nie."

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Organi&zation:"
msgstr "Organisasie:"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "Reply-&to address:"
msgstr "Antwoord-na adres:"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid ""
"Here you can enter the name of your organization, company or university. This "
"field is <em>optional</em>. However, if you are using a business account and "
"communicate with persons working for other companies, providing the name of "
"your organization is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Hier kan u die naam van u organisasie, maatskappy of universiteit "
"invoer.Hierdie veld is <em>opsioneel</em>. As u egter 'n besigheidsrekenening "
"gebruik en met persone werksaam in ander maatskappye kommunikeer, word "
"dieverskaf van die naam van u organisasie aanbeveel."

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "E&mail address:"
msgstr "E-pos adres:"

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"Enter your full name here, e.g. \"John Doe\" (without the quotation\n"
"marks). Some people like to provide a nickname only. You can leave this field "
"blank and still use email. However, providing your full name is <em>"
"recommended</em> as this makes it much easier for your recipient to browse his "
"or her email."
msgstr ""
"Voer u volledige naam hier in, byvoorbeeld \"John Doe\" (sonder die aanhaling\n"
" merke). Sommige mense hou daarvan om  slegs 'n bynaam te verskaf. U kan "
"hierdie veld leeg laat en nogsteeds e-pos gebruik. Die verskaffing van u "
"volledige naam word egter<em>aanbeveel</em> omrede dit, dit baie makliker vir u "
"ontvanger maak om deursy of haar e-pos te blaai."

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Full &name:"
msgstr "Volle naam:"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "SMTP server:"
msgstr "SMTP bediener"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"<qt>You can specify the server to send mail to here.\n"
"<br>"
"<br> SMTP means Simple Mail Transfer Protocol and is the standard way to send "
"mail.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>U kan die bediener om die pos te stuur hier spesifiseer.\n"
"<br>"
"<br> SMTP beteken Eenvoudige Pos Oorplaas protokol en is die standaard manierom "
"pos te stuur.</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "C&urrent profile:"
msgstr "Huidige Profiel:"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "&New Profile..."
msgstr "Nuwe Profiel..."
